\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  When we look around this wide earth
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   We need to be so happy.
\par  Look at all these beautiful things
\par  that God have created all
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The earth and its beautiful things
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   are all under the Lords feet.
\par   Many things that He created;
\par   It is also one of them.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  The sun gives us warmth and pleasure,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  the moon makes us so happy
\par   the stars also gives us beauty.
\par   They all give to us great joy.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  God's creation is abundant
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   they are under His Kingdom,
\par   And the Almighty God Himself
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0      His glory abounds them all
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  If the foot stool of the Lord God
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   shine so bright in His Kingdom
\par   What kind of Love and of glory
\par \pard   shall the Father missed in heart?\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

